SUMMARY:Redd The Singing Bartender Show
LOCATION:Redd's Pub\, 3906 Hwy 98 W\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:A true local gem\, Redd’s Pub delivers an experience that’s
  become a South Walton tradition. Redd\, the Singing Bartender\, still tak
 es center stage most nights\, performing her signature one-woman show whil
 e greeting guests\, taking requests and serving up crowd favorites like sl
 ow-cooked ribs\, brisket nachos and Southern comfort food. Equal parts nei
 ghborhood pub\, live music venue and community gath…\n\nTimes\, the live
  map and the app: https://30anow.github.io/e/5b8c9532-2885-4933-a811-acdb6
 62fa871
